{
  "esm": "2.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "strain_divu_corner4",
    "description": "Scalar atom of the B-grid strain-rate divergence at corner 4 (the SE corner, U(i,j-1)) of T cell (i,j): divu_4 = cyp*u(i,j-1) - dyT*u(i-1,j-1) + cxm*v(i,j-1) + dxT*v(i,j) (strain_rates, ice_dyn_shared.F90:2160-2163). Index params as on strain_divu_corner1 (oi/oj = i/j, wim1/wjm1 = the west/south neighbors, bound to 1 on the i = 1 / j = 1 halo strips by the strain_rates_divu rule); metric coefficients and cell dimensions are scalars of the cell.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:stencil", "family:cice_bgrid", "grid:cice_bgrid", "op:strain-rate"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Hunke, E. C., et al. (2023). CICE v6.3.22 documentation and user's guide (LA-UR-23-31851)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "strain_divu_corner4": {
      "params": ["uvel", "vvel", "oi", "oj", "wim1", "wjm1", "cxp", "cyp", "cxm", "cym", "dxT", "dyT"],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              { "op": "*", "args": ["cyp", { "op": "index", "args": ["uvel", "oi", "wjm1"] }] },
              { "op": "*", "args": ["dyT", { "op": "index", "args": ["uvel", "wim1", "wjm1"] }] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              { "op": "*", "args": ["cxm", { "op": "index", "args": ["vvel", "oi", "wjm1"] }] },
              { "op": "*", "args": ["dxT", { "op": "index", "args": ["vvel", "oi", "oj"] }] }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
